1038	     * whitespace) joined to the postcode by {@code '|'}. This is the single definition of which
1039	     * owner fields make up a household and how they are normalized;
1040	     * {@link #householdIdFor(String, String)} hashes this key into the stored identifier, so any two
1041	     * owners in the same household resolve to the same key and therefore the same identifier.
